OL,3,GNEWSAPumpkin patch saved by lucky
OL,4,Adecision last year
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimon Walton, farmer at Baydale Farm in
OL,7,FDarlington, said they had been really
OL,8,Fbadly impacted by the droughts last
OL,9,Fyear, but a lucky decision in the
OL,10,Faftermath has meant they can open as
OL,11,Fusual this year.
